**Profile**: Title: Blake Bloom.

A '''Blake Bloom''' is the symbol of identity for the members of the [[Black Shores]]. Each of them possesses their own Blake Bloom, hence why members are also called 'Bloom Bearers.'

==Description==
According to [[Verina]], the flower is a type of [[Remnant]] plant and contains a very unique kind of Remnant Energy..

Shaped by the unique environment of the Black Shores, the rare Remnant plant has since become the region's symbol. Under the influence of the [[Tacetite|Tacetites]], any ordinary plant that takes root in the Black Shores will gradually lose its natural colors.